// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4105727815" "<color orange>Bobcat spots you and her tail flips playfully as you approach.</color><br><br>You got him! {Hero.gender=male Oh, I knew you could do it my big handsome man!|I knew you had the instincts for this sort of thing, you and me, we're two of a kind.}<br><br>I'll make sure Neuron gets his little play thing and then maybe fish for a kiss before he <i>goes back to work</i>. Ugh, did you know I can't even get him to come here to Studio 55? He says it's too boring, all the sitting around and wasting time watching people. Pffft, he has no idea what he's missing.<br><br><color orange>You notice Bobcat watching one of the Canary Dancers. She catches you catching her and smirks.</color><br><br>What, I can't look?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BobcatDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1836073631" "{Hero.gender=male I have this totally hot outfit I'm going to wear for this!|I have this totally cute outfit I'm going to wear for this. Oh! You could get a matching outfit! We would be <i>so</i> cute!}"
// Answer Text :
"P1533406739" "Let's go rob a bank."
// Answer Text :
"P337172684" "I'm not ready yet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P83807682" "Shen's on his way to <i>Captain Workaholic's</i> lab. He told me that he was very <i>proud</i> of my work, blah, blah, blah...<br><br><color orange>Bobcat's ears press down and she fumes.</color><br><br>Proud!? Are you kidding me?! Does he think I'm a little kitten!?<br><br><color orange>Bobcat relaxes and smirks, reflecting on her words.</color><br><br>{Hero.gender=male Well, I <i>am</i> cute, aren't I?|Well, this kitten has claws, and teeth, and a very bad temper when people don't respect her...}<br><br>I'm going to prove to Neuron that I don't need him to be <i>proud</i> of me. I want to show him that I don't need him. Why shouldn't <i>I</i> be a Praetor... like Domi? I could be <i>The Praetor of Cuteness</i>! Hey, that's not a bad idea. I mean, I'm really good at it anyway, why not get rewarded for it? I mean, more so than normal.<br><br>Listen, you helped scratch my back, so now I'm gonna scratch yours. <color orange>What can we do to show Neuron that I'm my own kitty?</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3711203050" "Ask what Neuron wanted with Shen"
// SendOffString :
"P100413118" "Shen? Oh, he's got a bunch of money or something...<br><br>Wait! Is that it? Is that what Neuron wants? Money? If I have a lot of money maybe he'll want me too!<br><br><color orange>Bobcat gives you a mischievous look.</color><br><br>Are you suggesting we rob the Imperial Bank of Praetoria? {Hero.gender=male That. Is. So. Hot!|This town won't know what hit it! I can see the TPN news cast now. Two femme fatale bank robbers rob Imperial Bank!} Oh! I have the perfect outfit!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P354968838" "Rob The Imperial Bank of Praetoria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2685890501" "This is gonna be so much fun!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P5653195" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: ...I'll Scratch My Back</color>"

